meta {
  name: Media Upload
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/{{table}}/{{recordId}}/upload
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept-Language: oz
}

body:multipart-form {
  files: @file(_samples/sample.png)
  ~lang: oz
}

docs {
  Mavjud yozuvga fayl qo'shish. `table` va `recordId` env o'zgaruvchilaridan olinadi.

  Ruxsat etilgan table:
    pages | menu | branches | usefuls | coaches | directions

  Cheklovlar:
    rasm (jpg/jpeg/png/webp) - max 5MB (pages, menu, branches, usefuls, coaches, directions)
    mp4 (video, menu)        - max 100MB
    bitta so'rovda max 100 ta fayl

  lang - har bir faylga til (oz|ru|uz|en|all). Yuborilsa FAYL SONI BILAN TENG bo'lishi shart.
         Bo'sh/all = barcha tillarda ko'rinadi.

  Birinchi yuklangan fayl avtomatik is_main bo'ladi (agar yozuvda fayl bo'lmagan bo'lsa).
}
